# Pokretanje: F5 u Visual Studiu ili `dotnet run` (profil iz Properties/launchSettings.json)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100

### Health: 200 {"status":"OK"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Zadaci 1-3: 200 "Order confirmed", konzola: Email: ... ili SMS: ...
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/confirm

### Zadatak 4: { first, second, same }; pozovi dvaput za svaki lifetime (pre zadatka 4: 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/di/lifetime
